{
  "oifm_id": "OIFM_MGB_212259",
  "name": "latarjet procedure",
  "description": "Surgical transfer of the coracoid process to the anteroinferior glenoid for shoulder stabilization. Describes presence and status of the procedure, graft and screw position, and associated findings such as glenoid bone loss and recurrent dislocation.",
